1404:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_can.c **** /**
1405:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_can.c ****   * @brief  Check if a transmission request is pending on the selected Tx
1406:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_can.c ****   *         Mailboxes.
1407:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_can.c ****   * @param  hcan pointer to an CAN_HandleTypeDef structure that contains
1408:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_can.c ****   *         the configuration information for the specified CAN.
1409:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_can.c ****   * @param  TxMailboxes List of Tx Mailboxes to check.
1410:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_can.c ****   *         This parameter can be any combination of @arg CAN_Tx_Mailboxes.
1411:Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f1xx_hal_can.c ****   * @retval Status
